	"title"		"Viewpoint Extended Support"
	"description"		"[h1]Viewpoint Extended Support[/h1] Quality-of-life and compatibility features for Project Viewpoint in Project Zomboid Build 42.20+. [h2]Camera and mouse[/h2] [list][*]Automatically switch to third person when entering vehicles and return to first person after exiting.[*]Hold Mouse Button 4 for free mouse control; customize the bind and its Shift, Ctrl, or Alt modifiers.[*]Automatically release and center the mouse once when opening an inventory or supported menu. The cursor stays free while the interface is open and centers again when reopened.[*]Preserves Viewpoint's native middle-mouse cursor toggle.[*]Integrates with vanilla and Ergonomic UI inventories: inventory scrolling takes priority, and the Viewpoint interaction menu can be hidden while the inventory is open.[/list] [h2]Interaction improvements[/h2] [list][*]Shows what you are interacting with in the heading, such as [i]Interact with Ground[/i].[*]Cycle nearby interaction targets with the Left and Right arrow keys or a configurable modifier plus mouse wheel (Alt+wheel by default).[*]Collapse container contents into a separate submenu for each container (enabled by default and configurable).[*]Optional cascading interaction menus with deferred [i]View options[/i] loading.[*]Preserves vanilla interaction icons and optionally integrates with Simple Context Menu Icons.[/list] [h2]Optional mod integrations[/h2] [list][*]Project A-Life: access NPC interaction actions through Viewpoint and show NPC name tags when aiming at them.[*]Companion Dogs: camera-aware name-tag positioning and exclusion of Friendly and Allied A-Life NPCs from threat detection.[*]Wolf Extraction Quest: start the Extraction Tracker closed when loading a save. This is configurable and does not prevent opening the tracker manually.[/list] [h2]Configuration[/h2] Customize features and key binds in the in-game Mod Options. Automatic Viewpoint startup, skipping the setup screen, and diagnostic logging are disabled by default. Perspective switching, camera zoom, firearm aiming, and weapon behavior remain handled by Project Viewpoint. [h2]Requirements[/h2] [list][*]Project Viewpoint[*]ZombieBuddy 2.3.0 or newer[*]Project Zomboid Build 42.20+[*]Other supported mods are optional and required only for their respective integrations.[/list] [h2]Mod information[/h2] [list][*]Workshop ID: 3812978679[*]Mod ID: ViewpointExtendedSupport[/list]"
	"changenote"		"0.4.38: Add configurable modifier+scroll interaction-target cycling (Alt+wheel by default) and container submenus, enabled by default."
}
